# Reading: 12 of the 14 changed shots have a float logit within 0.08 of zero (rounding at the boundary); the other two
# (3714, 3851) saturate nothing, the difference grows smoothly block by block, and the float network itself swings their
# logits by 3 to 6 under a nudge of the size of the 16-bit rounding. That is the network's sensitivity on those shots,
# not an error of the arithmetic.
